# Calendar colour system (pomodoro-calendario-ui u5): amber focus tint, item dots (task / event / reminder /
# deadline), today = number in a filled circle, selected = light outline; legend with the five entries.
# Needs the seed (python .claude/scripts/seed_progress_db.py --device): focus on past days, today's tasks, and a
# pending task + project deadline 3 days from today (the "other day with items" this walk selects; in the last
# three days of a month that day is in the next month and the TAP below lands on the legend instead).
# Each month cell's content description says its marks ("20, Selected, Task, Deadline"), so a day is picked by
# what it holds, not by its position.
# Run: python bbadb.py run-steps .claude/skills/adb-ui-test/steps/pcu-calendar.steps --save pcu-calendar
GRANT android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
START .configuration.SplashActivity
WAIT 5000
TAP id=navigation_calendar_month
WAIT 2000
ASSERT id=monthCalendarView
ASSERT id=calendarLegend
ASSERT id=legendReminder
ASSERT id=legendFocus
SHOT pcu-calendar-month-today
TAP text=deadline|entrega
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=dayDetailTitle
SHOT pcu-calendar-month-other-day
SWIPE 540 1400 540 500 300
WAIT 800
ASSERT id=calendarAgendaCard
ASSERT id=dayDetailRecycler
SHOT pcu-calendar-day-list
# Selecting a day with focus: the outline goes around the amber tint, which stays visible.
SWIPE 540 600 540 1500 300
WAIT 800
TAP text=focus|enfoque
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=dayDetailTitle
SHOT pcu-calendar-selected-focus-day
